CREATE TABLE table_name(id INT AUTO_INCREMENT, name VARCHAR(255), PRIMARY KEY (id));
not natively supported by the DataFrame API, but there are several ways to achieve the same
functionality. 
from pyspark.sql.functions import monotonically_increasing_id 
df = df.withColumn("id", monotonically_increasing_id ()+ start_value